{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FF7SGrMamcNYLTNEhoY2Bn","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod_0510/projects/causal_annot_error_attrib/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **mvp_exposure_dirichlet_subspace** (success): Dirichlet(1,1,1) 均匀先验下 85% 违反率在高对角占优子空间（min(diag(C))≥0.7，接近真实 LLM 精度）是否骤降：若 >10% 则论文 claim 对实际 LLM 有现实意义，若 <1% 需标注适用范围\\\\n- **mvp_exposure_dag** (success): K=3 非差异性 exposure 误分类打破二分类 bias-toward-null 保证：存在 C 结构使 treatment effect 估计产生符号反转或效应放大，而 K=2 下非差异性误分类始终保证衰减\\\\n- **mvp_confounding_dag** (success): K=3 混淆矩阵下 confounding DAG 的 OLS 偏差可由 plim=(E[Z'Z])^{-1}E[Z'X]β 精确预测，且 K=3 偏差与二分类折叠偏差系统性不同（多分类保留更多混杂信息）\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 3 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 3\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nhome-1x5090: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 652, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01X5U59p15txfrnbsJEjXGux","session_id":"44efd5d7-3d5f-464d-80ca-d3c01b5a58d8","uuid":"27a56ba8-dc85-4048-9708-1b113c44137c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:49:36.279Z"}
